{"seq":2,"slug":"chargeback-dispute-evidence-liability","title":"拒付申诉、举证材料与欺诈保障责任","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-payment-fraud-decisioning-risk-engine/review-ops-guarantee-feedback-loop/chargeback-dispute-evidence-liability","wordCount":3013,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"拒付申诉-举证材料与欺诈保障责任\">拒付申诉、举证材料与欺诈保障责任</h1><p>一笔被授权通过、事后又被持卡人否认的交易，会把风控系统在几百毫秒内做过的判断重新拖回一个以「天」和「月」为单位的行政流程里。授权前的拦截是概率游戏，拒付处理则是证据与时限的游戏：谁在什么时间点、用什么材料、向哪一方主张责任，决定了损失最终落在商户、收单机构还是发卡行。这是把「已经损失的钱」转成「下次不再损失」的唯一途径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这条流程有四个角色：持卡人、发卡行（issuer）、收单机构（acquirer，代表商户）、卡组织（Visa/Mastercard，裁定争议）；以及三个动作：拒付（chargeback，资金反向划走）、反证（representment，商户提交材料争取推翻）、责任转移（liability shift，把损失责任从商户移到发卡行）。跨境电商业态下的四条关键立场是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>举证责任决定损失归属而非谁「有理」，责任未转移时沉默等于败诉。</li>\n<li>单笔拒付的代价是本金加商品、人力、手续费与监控罚金的组合。</li>\n<li>拒付结果是唯一由持卡人主动确认的正样本来源。</li>\n<li>立案到举证截止通常只有 7–21 天，预警窗口更短至 24 小时。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"拒付不是终点-从原因码到责任归属\">拒付不是终点：从原因码到责任归属</h2><p>拒付由发卡行代表持卡人发起，资金先从商户侧划走，商户有机会提交反证材料争取推翻。真正决定「这笔钱能不能要回来」的，不是商户是否有理，而是<strong>争议落在哪个原因码上、交易在那条原因码下是否已经发生了责任转移</strong>。Visa 的 <code>10.4</code>（Other Fraud — Card-Absent Environment）与 Mastercard 的 <code>4837</code>（No Cardholder Authorization）是跨境电商业态下最致命的欺诈原因码，直接计入欺诈率统计；<code>4853</code>、<code>4855</code>（Goods or Services Not Received）、<code>4863</code> 等非欺诈类原因码计入总争议率但路径不同。判断的第一步永远是<strong>把原因码映射到责任规则</strong>：只有欺诈类原因码在满足条件下才可能发生责任转移，商品未收到类拒付无论 3DS 认证与否都由商户承担举证责任。\n责任转移最成熟的机制是 3D Secure。当交易通过 3DS 认证（无论挑战流还是无摩擦流），欺诈类拒付的责任从商户转向发卡行；但有一个常被忽略的陷阱——<strong>如果收单方为本来需要 SCA 的交易申请了豁免（exemption）并以无摩擦方式通过，这笔交易就失去责任转移保护</strong>。引擎在决定「哪些交易申请豁免」时，是在用责任转移的确定性换取转化率，必须在成本矩阵里显式建模。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  AUTH[授权通过并清算] --&gt; CB[持卡人否认&lt;br/&gt;发卡行发起拒付]&#10;  CB --&gt; CODE{原因码判定}&#10;  CODE --&gt;|欺诈类 10.4 / 4837| LIAB{责任是否已转移?}&#10;  CODE --&gt;|非欺诈类 4855 / 4853| MERCH[商户举证责任]&#10;  LIAB --&gt;|3DS 认证通过&lt;br/&gt;且未申请豁免| SHIFT[责任在发卡行]&#10;  LIAB --&gt;|无认证或豁免通过| MERCH&#10;  MERCH --&gt; PRESENT[提交反证材料]&#10;  PRESENT --&gt; DEC{发卡行裁定}&#10;  DEC --&gt;|胜诉| RECOVER[追回本金]&#10;  DEC --&gt;|败诉| ACCEPT[接受拒付]&#10;  ACCEPT --&gt; LABEL[标签回流]&#10;  RECOVER --&gt; LABEL\">graph TD\n  AUTH[授权通过并清算] --&gt; CB[持卡人否认&lt;br/&gt;发卡行发起拒付]\n  CB --&gt; CODE{原因码判定}\n  CODE --&gt;|欺诈类 10.4 / 4837| LIAB{责任是否已转移?}\n  CODE --&gt;|非欺诈类 4855 / 4853| MERCH[商户举证责任]\n  LIAB --&gt;|3DS 认证通过&lt;br/&gt;且未申请豁免| SHIFT[责任在发卡行]\n  LIAB --&gt;|无认证或豁免通过| MERCH\n  MERCH --&gt; PRESENT[提交反证材料]\n  PRESENT --&gt; DEC{发卡行裁定}\n  DEC --&gt;|胜诉| RECOVER[追回本金]\n  DEC --&gt;|败诉| ACCEPT[接受拒付]\n  ACCEPT --&gt; LABEL[标签回流]\n  RECOVER --&gt; LABEL</pre><h2 id=\"举证材料的规范与卡组织特别程序\">举证材料的规范与卡组织特别程序</h2><p>材料必须<strong>命中原因码对应的举证清单</strong>。非面对面欺诈拒付的有效材料包括 AVS/CVV 校验结果、3DS 认证结果与 ECI 标识、设备指纹与 IP、收货地址与物流签收、账户登录历史、客服往来记录；商品未收到类要求物流跟踪号、签收凭证、交付确认。文件有硬性限制：单笔争议的反证材料合计不超过 4.5 MB，Mastercard 不超过 19 页，且发卡行审核人员不会打开外部链接、音视频或要求电话联系的说明。两个卡组织的替代举证程序把举证升级为<strong>结构化数据核对</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>程序</th>\n<th>卡组织</th>\n<th>适用原因码</th>\n<th>数据要求</th>\n<th>生效/范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Compelling Evidence 3.0</td>\n<td>Visa</td>\n<td>仅 <code>10.4</code></td>\n<td>两笔 120–365 天前、从未被报为欺诈的交易，至少 2 项标识匹配，其中至少 1 项为 IP 或设备指纹</td>\n<td>2023 年 4 月生效，全球</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>First-Party Trust</td>\n<td>Mastercard</td>\n<td><code>4837</code> 等欺诈类</td>\n<td>121–365 天前两笔未被报欺诈的交易，需设备标识 + 交付要素 + 附加要素各 1 项</td>\n<td>2024 年 10 月起美国境内，需接入 Consumer Clarity</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CE3.0 的关键设计是<strong>把历史正常交易当作证据</strong>：商户只要能证明「同一张卡、同一台设备、同一个收货地址在过去 4–12 个月内有过未被否认的成功交易」，Visa 就倾向认定本次争议属于第一方欺诈（friendly fraud）而非盗刷。这要求系统在<strong>每一笔正常交易发生时</strong>就持久化设备指纹、IP、登录 ID、收货地址并按卡哈希建索引——如果引擎只保留风险分而不保留原始标识，事后根本无法组成 CE3.0 所需的匹配证据。两个程序的年龄窗口都在 120 天量级，说明「至少留存 12 个月的可匹配交易标识」是底线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"争议前拦截-把拒付消灭在立案之前\">争议前拦截：把拒付消灭在立案之前</h2><p>等到拒付立案再举证已经太晚——立案后即使胜诉，争议仍已计入比率，争议手续费仍已产生。成熟做法是把处理前移到争议前阶段：发卡行在正式立案前把疑似争议推送给第三方网络，商户在几十小时内决定退款或补充订单信息。这条路径唯一的价值差异是<strong>响应窗口</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>服务</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>响应窗口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Verifi CDRN</td>\n<td>非欺诈类争议预警</td>\n<td>最长 72 小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ethoca Alerts</td>\n<td>欺诈类拒付预警</td>\n<td>24 小时内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Verifi Order Insight / Ethoca Consumer Clarity</td>\n<td>订单信息实时回传（Visa / Mastercard 各一）</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rapid Dispute Resolution (RDR)</td>\n<td>商户预设规则自动接受/退款</td>\n<td>规则驱动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Order Insight / Consumer Clarity 作用于<strong>争议发生的最上游</strong>：持卡人来电说不认识这笔扣款时，发卡行客服界面直接显示商户名、下单时间、商品描述、收货地址，多数「不认得账单描述符」的争议在挂断前就消解。RDR 则把「哪些争议值得直接退款」写成规则。接进反欺诈引擎意味着一个反直觉的闭环：<strong>引擎的决策输出需要携带「如果被拒付，该退让还是该硬拼」的策略标签</strong>，由历史胜率与成本模型算出。判据是期望收益：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>EV</mtext><mtext>represent</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>win</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>cb</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>win</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>evidence</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>fight</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EV}_{\\text{represent}} = p_{\\text{win}} \\cdot (A + F_{\\text{cb}}) - (1-p_{\\text{win}}) \\cdot C_{\\text{evidence}} - F_{\\text{fight}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">represent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">win</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">win</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">evidence</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fight</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为争议金额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>cb</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{cb}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为拒付手续费，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>evidence</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{evidence}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">evidence</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为举证的人力与机会成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>fight</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{\\text{fight}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fight</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为抗辩手续费。只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EV</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EV} &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 的案件才进入举证队列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"责任成本-拒付费率-监控项目与罚金\">责任成本：拒付费率、监控项目与罚金</h2><p>拒付的真正费用远高于争议本金。行业测算显示，一笔拒付在计入本金、商品损失、处理人力与手续费后的<strong>平均综合成本约 128 美元</strong>，而打包商收取的争议处理费通常在每笔 20–100 美元区间。更重的成本来自卡组织的监控项目：它们不惩罚单笔争议，而是<strong>按月份统计比率</strong>，越线即进入罚款、整改甚至清算限制的升级阶梯。Visa 已将监控口径上移到收单机构级（VAMP），2026 年 4 月生效的阈值与罚金如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>判定口径</th>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>罚金</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Visa VAMP 收单机构 Above Standard</td>\n<td>欺诈+争议比率</td>\n<td>0.5% 至不足 0.7%</td>\n<td>每笔合乎条件的事件 4 美元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visa VAMP 收单机构 Excessive</td>\n<td>欺诈+争议比率</td>\n<td>≥ 0.7%</td>\n<td>每笔 8 美元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Visa VAMP 商户 Excessive</td>\n<td>欺诈+争议比率</td>\n<td>1.5%（CEMEA 2.2%）</td>\n<td>每笔 8 美元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mastercard ECM / HECM</td>\n<td>单月争议笔数 + 争议率</td>\n<td>100–299 笔且 ≥1.5%（HECM 为 ≥300 笔且 ≥3%）</td>\n<td>逐级升至 100,000 / 200,000 美元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mastercard EFM</td>\n<td>净欺诈额 + 欺诈争议率 + 3DS 覆盖率</td>\n<td>净欺诈 &gt; 50,000 美元、欺诈率 &gt; 0.50%、3DS 覆盖低于 10%/50%</td>\n<td>递进罚金至 100,000 美元</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>VAMP 两档阈值都有 1,500 笔的最低月度计数门槛，费用评估自 2025 年 10 月 1 日已开始执行。比率定义本身值得记牢：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>VAMP ratio</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>TC40</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>欺诈</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>TC15</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>非欺诈争议</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>captured</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>已捕获交易</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{VAMP ratio} = \\frac{N_{\\text{TC40}}(\\text{欺诈}) + N_{\\text{TC15}}(\\text{非欺诈争议})}{N_{\\text{captured}}(\\text{已捕获交易})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">VAMP ratio</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3991em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">captured</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已捕获交易</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TC40</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">欺诈</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TC15</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">非欺诈争议</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分子把 TC40 与 TC15 简单相加，且<strong>同一笔欺诈交易若同时出现在两份报告中会被重复计数</strong>——引擎面板上「自家口径的争议率」与卡组织口径存在系统性偏差，必须按卡组织的分子定义重建统计。Visa 还有一条 2026 年 10 月起适用于亚太地区的 MERP，其后果包含<strong>追溯性欺诈拒付</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"标签回流-把拒付结果变成模型信号\">标签回流：把拒付结果变成模型信号</h2><p>拒付流程对反欺诈引擎最大的价值，是它提供了<strong>最干净的欺诈标签</strong>。授权时的拒绝没有 ground truth——被拒交易可能本就是欺诈，也可能是误杀；而拒付是持卡人主动否认，是确认的正样本。这条标签链路有三个固有缺陷。</p>\n<p>第一是<strong>标签滞后</strong>。发卡行立案窗口通常为交易后 120 天，极端可延至 540 天。训练时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t-120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 天之前的样本标签才基本完整，之后的样本处于「未成熟」状态，直接用它们训练会系统性低估近期欺诈率。正确做法是对每个样本计算<strong>成熟度</strong>（maturity），只有标签窗口已过的样本才计入正负样本。</p>\n<p>第二是<strong>样本选择偏差</strong>。只有被放行的交易才可能产生拒付，被拒绝的交易永远不会出现在回流样本里，构成典型的拒绝推断（reject inference）问题：直接用放行样本的拒付标签训练，模型只能学会识别「已经足够可疑但还被放行」的欺诈。缓解方式是对被拒样本做加权或引入拒绝推断估计反事实标签。</p>\n<p>第三是<strong>标签的语义分层</strong>。被 CE3.0 或 First-Party Trust 反证成功的案件，说明交易是真实持卡人发起的（第一方欺诈或误认），与盗刷是两种完全不同的攻击形态，混进同一个正样本池会稀释模型对盗刷的识别力。合理做法是把标签分成 <code>欺诈成立（盗刷）</code>、<code>第一方欺诈确认</code>、<code>非欺诈类争议（服务/物流）</code>、<code>误杀（持卡人误报后撤销）</code> 四类分开落库。最后一步是把标签接到特征侧：时间点连接必须保证对每一个标签时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的样本，特征值取的是标签时刻之前最后一次写入的值。最常见的泄漏是「拒付率类特征」——如果账户级特征把当前这笔拒付算进了历史拒付率，模型会学到一个线上根本不存在的强信号，离线虚高、上线即崩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>拒付申诉不只是后台流程，它同时是<strong>成本中心、合规闸门和模型标签源</strong>。把它接进引擎需要在四个位置做对设计：授权阶段对 3DS 豁免的取舍要显式建模责任转移损失；交易发生时就持久化 CE3.0 / First-Party Trust 所需的历史匹配标识并保证 12 个月可检索；监控面板按卡组织的分子定义重建比率统计；标签回流按成熟度与语义分层处理，避免滞后与选择偏差污染训练集。风险分层与阈值校准见 <a href=\"../fraud-taxonomy-decision-economics/risk-tier-threshold-policy-calibration\">风险分层与阈值策略校准</a>，在线特征服务见 <a href=\"../decision-engine-rules-model-fusion/online-model-scoring-feature-serving\">模型评分在线推理与特征服务链路</a>。\n来源：Visa CE3.0 规则（2023 年 4 月生效）；Visa Acquirer Monitoring Program Fact Sheet 2025 与 Chargebacks911 VAMP 条目（2026 年 4 月阈值、罚金、2025 年 10 月 1 日执行）；Mastercard ECP/EFM 与 First-Party Trust 规则（Chargebacks911 与 Stripe Monitoring Programs）；Stripe Disputes 文档（7–21 天窗口、4.5 MB / 19 页限制）；Verifi CDRN / Ethoca Alerts / Order Insight / RDR 对比（Chargebacks911）；单笔拒付综合成本约 128 美元（Chargebacks911，援引 Visa 口径）；3DS 责任转移与 SCA 豁免失效（Stripe 3D Secure 2 指南）。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拒付申诉、举证材料与欺诈保障责任","id":"拒付申诉-举证材料与欺诈保障责任"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"拒付不是终点：从原因码到责任归属","id":"拒付不是终点-从原因码到责任归属"},{"level":2,"text":"举证材料的规范与卡组织特别程序","id":"举证材料的规范与卡组织特别程序"},{"level":2,"text":"争议前拦截：把拒付消灭在立案之前","id":"争议前拦截-把拒付消灭在立案之前"},{"level":2,"text":"责任成本：拒付费率、监控项目与罚金","id":"责任成本-拒付费率-监控项目与罚金"},{"level":2,"text":"标签回流：把拒付结果变成模型信号","id":"标签回流-把拒付结果变成模型信号"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"人审队列、工单工作流与审核台工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-payment-fraud-decisioning-risk-engine/review-ops-guarantee-feedback-loop/manual-review-queue-workflow-agent-console"},"next":{"title":"拒付标签回流、模型再训练与漂移监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/realtime-payment-fraud-decisioning-risk-engine/review-ops-guarantee-feedback-loop/label-feedback-retraining-drift-monitoring"}}